    MC @ smile "헤, 넌 가끔 네 자신에게조차 너무 빨리 말하고 생각하는 법을 배우고 있어, 뮤."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:374
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7368d55b:

    # MYU "... Myu do bad?"
    MYU "... 뮤가 잘못했어?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:375
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_48449b6e:

    # MC @ smile "Not at all, Myu."
    MC @ smile "전혀 아니야, 뮤."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:376
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0d7cba86:

    # MC @ talk "Anyway, moving on..."
    MC @ talk "어쨌든, 계속 가자..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:384
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_6dadeaea:

    # MC @ talk "This is where most normal students are taught."
    MC @ talk "여기가 대부분의 평범한 학생들이 가르침을 받는 곳이야."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:385
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7506ecb0:

