    # MC @ smile "A lot actually, everything from basic defense to economics to about a hundred other things."
    MC @ smile "사실 엄청 많아, 기본 방어부터 경제학, 그리고 백 가지쯤 되는 다른 것들까지."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:389
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_fe04ca43:

    # MC @ talk "The idea is they delegate you into a job best suited to your results during a festival we call the Terminus ceremony."
    MC @ talk "개념은 그들이 터미너스 의식이라는 축제 때 네 결과에 가장 적합한 직업으로 배정하는 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:390
translate kr qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0f714875:

    # MYU "What if you get a job you don't like?"
    MYU "싫어하는 직업을 가지면 어쩌지?"

