    # MYU "..."
    MYU "..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:913
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_db4a1e82:

    # "Myu said nothing, but I can feel something {i}changing{/i} beneath my armour."
    "뮤는 아무 말도 하지 않았지만, 내 갑옷 아래에서 무언가 {i}변하는{/i} 것을 느낄 수 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:914
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_bf69987f:

    # "She might not have been able to understand all the words said just now, but she could {i}sense{/i} the men before her were hostile, and just like that, her animal instincts kicked in."
    "그녀가 방금 전에 한 모든 말을 이해할 수는 없었을지 모르지만, 앞에 있는 남자들이 적대적이라는 것을 {i}감지{/i}할 수 있었고, 그와 동시에 그녀의 동물적 본능이 발동했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:915
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_37060419:

    # "Pouring out of my armour, she re-formed herself in a frightening visage of sharp blades and teeth, snarling at the terrified bandits who immediately began to panic."
    "내 갑옷 밖으로 쏟아져 나와, 그녀는 날카로운 칼날과 이빨의 무시무시한 모습으로 자신을 재구성하고, 즉시 공포에 질려 패닉에 빠진 도적들에게 으르렁거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:918
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_81f87009:

    # MYU "{i}*Snarls!*{/i}"
    MYU "{i}*으르렁!*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:923
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_d39f0328:

    # THUG "WHAT THE FUCK IS THAT?!"
    THUG "저게 씨발 뭐야?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:924
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_74096ffd:

    # THUG "Kill it! KILL IT NOW!"
    THUG "죽여! 지금 당장 죽여!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:928
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_49fa8301:

    # "As I drew my blade down across the last thug, I turned to see Myu."
    "마지막 깡패를 내 칼로 베어 넘기고, 나는 뮤를 보기 위해 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:934
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_2cd07a6f:

    # "Having eviscerated one of the bandits into a bloody pulp of flesh and blood, she was dissolving and devouring his flesh."
    "도적 한 명을 피와 살점의 핏빛 덩어리로 적출한 그녀는, 그의 살을 녹이고 게걸스럽게 먹어치우고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:935
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_022d254d:

    # "The Blood splatter on her body was absorbed through her skin, and the cute innocence she had conveyed until now was all but gone."
    "그녀의 몸에 튄 피는 피부를 통해 흡수되었고, 지금까지 전달했던 귀여운 순수함은 거의 사라져 버렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:936
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_fa64eac2:

    # "Only this ghastly nightmare stood before me, lapping up the warm blood like milk."
    "오직 이 섬뜩한 악몽만이 내 앞에 서서, 따뜻한 피를 우유처럼 핥아먹고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:937
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_c728332a:

    # "One of the bandits still squirmed as she pressed her bladed hand into his body."
    "도적 한 명이 그녀가 칼날 같은 손을 그의 몸에 찔러 넣자 아직도 꿈틀거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:939
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_796deab9:

    # "Small tendrils pushed through his ripped open eye sockets and mouth."
    "작은 촉수들이 그의 찢어진 눈구멍과 입을 통해 밀고 들어갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:940
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_011a31cb:

    # "Tentacles tore their way through his body and could be seen shifting about beneath the skin."
    "촉수들이 그의 몸을 찢고 지나가며 피부 아래에서 움직이는 것이 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:942
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_cc0c4ed1:

    # "He gargled and choked as the tentacles seemed to puppeteer him briefly till he finally fell still, dead and drained pale white."
    "그는 촉수들이 잠시 그를 꼭두각시처럼 조종하는 동안 목이 막혀 숨이 막혔고, 마침내 창백하게 피가 빠진 채 죽어 움직이지 않게 되었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:943
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_d06fcedc:

    # "For a moment, I considered abandoning this... {i}thing{/i} right here."
    "잠시, 나는 이... {i}것{/i}을 바로 여기 버릴까 생각했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:944
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_fbf28920:

    # "I could escape, let the City Guard handle this {i}monster{/i} standing before me."
    "나는 도망칠 수 있었고, 시 경비대가 내 앞에 서 있는 이 {i}괴물{/i}을 처리하게 할 수 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:946
translate kr qst_HumanExp_12_goHunting_5512e3fe:

    # "Myu, noticing my expression, stopped eating and dragged her way towards me, the voice once again sweet as that innocent face of hers returned."
    "뮤는 내 표정을 알아채고, 먹는 것을 멈추고 나에게로 기어왔다. 목소리는 다시 달콤해졌고, 그 순수한 얼굴이 돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:950
